DECISION
  gen_other under ~10% on the naive files: generation scoring holds up and
  the logit-diff patch is confirmatory, not required.
  gen_other high: those cells cannot be read from generations, and the logit
  difference is the only usable signal.
  Either way, report the disagreement count -- it is the number that says how
  much a steering result depends on which metric you chose.
